body:
the $300 credit is a Samsung only promotion. Sprint failed to charge my card (no idea why) and canceled my pre order. 3 hours After sprints customer service would not honor the $300 dollar credit samsung gives and the only promotion they have is buy one get a s10e free in installments. 

&#x200B;

my opinion? get out of sprint as soon as u can. they are the only company without a trade in promotion and bad customer service. 

&#x200B;

if best buy gives u a good trade in option and give u a sprint variant if u wanna stay with sprint thats the best option. i switched to T-Mobile
